{"id":"montagne","lemma":"montagne","pos":"noun","rank":1391,"glosses":["mountain","mountain (huge amount)","mountain (challenging task)"],"ipa":"/mɔ̃.taɲ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/0e/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Opsylac-montagne.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Opsylac-montagne.wav.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"montagnes"},"formAudio":{"montagnes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c5/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-montagnes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Regarde cette montagne.","en":"Look at that mountain.","words":[{"g":"to look at","l":"regarder"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null]},{"text":"Il fait des montagnes de tout.","en":"He makes mountains out of molehills.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"all"}]},{"text":"Il neige encore sur la montagne.","en":"It's snowing on the mountain again.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"snow"},{"g":"still"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Je pense partir à la montagne.","en":"I am thinking of going to the mountains.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"penser"},{"g":"to go away"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"a la"]]},{"text":"J'ai grandi dans les montagnes.","en":"I grew up in the mountains.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to grow, get bigger","l":"grandir"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]}]}